OL,3,GNEWSANew Council of Ministers revealed
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe Isle of Man's new Council of
OL,6,FMinisters has been announced, with
OL,7,Fthree political newcomers and more
OL,8,Fwomen than ever before.
OL,10,FWith the majority of the House of Keys
OL,11,Felected in September first-time
OL,12,Fpoliticians, ministers without previous
OL,13,Fexperience, had been expected.
OL,15,FBut there are a number of experienced
OL,16,Fmembers that have not been appointed,
OL,17,Fincluding the former Chief Minister
OL,18,FAlfred Cannan.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
