OL,3,GNEWSANew Council of Ministers revealed
OL,4,
OL,5,FChief Minister Chris Thomas said he had
OL,6,F"formed a team that will work together
OL,7,Fto get things done and deliver for the
OL,8,Fpeople of the Isle of Man".
